          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "યોજના (yojnā) is Sanskrit yojanā, \"joining, arranging\", taken over whole as a learned loan, a tatsama, on the root yuj, \"to join\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
